  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "601101",
      "subQuestName": "Return to Nasha Town and reunite with your companions",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60110101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60110101": {
            "id": "60110101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Everyone convenes, recounting what happened to them and sharing what they've learned...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110102"
            ]
          },
          "60110102": {
            "id": "60110102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Fortunately, we were able to minimize the harm. Only a few townspeople were hurt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110103"
            ]
          },
          "60110103": {
            "id": "60110103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "But the Rächer of Solnari has now gained a complete form, while we still know nothing about his goals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110104"
            ]
          },
          "60110104": {
            "id": "60110104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "It seems we have done something akin to releasing a vicious Qucusaur into the wild.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110105"
            ]
          },
          "60110105": {
            "id": "60110105",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "...I am sorry. Is no one here familiar with Qucusaurs?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110106"
            ]
          },
          "60110106": {
            "id": "60110106",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "P—Paimon knows what you mean, but that analogy seems more than slightly understated...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110107"
            ]
          },
          "60110107": {
            "id": "60110107",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "He said that this world means nothing to him, so it is possible that he doesn't have a reason to fight us at the moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110108"
            ]
          },
          "60110108": {
            "id": "60110108",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "If his objective had been revenge alone, we would likely have no recourse.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110109"
            ]
          },
          "60110109": {
            "id": "60110109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jahoda",
            "text": "Is there, uh, still time for me to tender my resignation?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110110"
            ]
          },
          "60110110": {
            "id": "60110110",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jahoda",
            "text": "Just kidding, just kidding! Don't worry, Boss, I know there's no running now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110111"
            ]
          },
          "60110111": {
            "id": "60110111",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "So my cannon, my pride and joy, was a hindrance rather than a help... Gah! You know what? I'm gonna dismantle it, right now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110114"
            ]
          },
          "60110114": {
            "id": "60110114",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's right, and it still works on normal Wild Hunt anomalies. Don't let this get you down, Aino!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110115"
            ]
          },
          "60110115": {
            "id": "60110115",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Flins, we'll need you to attend to the aftermath with the Lightkeepers. Don't worry, I've explained everything to them. You're in the clear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110116"
            ]
          },
          "60110116": {
            "id": "60110116",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "My thanks — for that, and for everything else I hear you did to help us arrive at the truth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110117"
            ]
          },
          "60110117": {
            "id": "60110117",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Had you been willing to show yourself in public more often, you would not have been so easy to isolate, you know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110118"
            ]
          },
          "60110118": {
            "id": "60110118",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Heh, point taken. I will give that some thought.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110119"
            ]
          },
          "60110119": {
            "id": "60110119",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Hmm. I suppose that's one way I'd benefit from replacing Sergeant Major Sousi...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110120"
            ]
          },
          "60110120": {
            "id": "60110120",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You mean, you're being promoted?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110121"
            ]
          },
          "60110121": {
            "id": "60110121",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "He's joking, Paimon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110122"
            ]
          },
          "60110122": {
            "id": "60110122",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Was Paimon the only one who didn't get that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110123"
            ]
          },
          "60110123": {
            "id": "60110123",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "#Well, {NICKNAME}, if you've got a moment, would you like to come with me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110124"
            ]
          },
          "60110124": {
            "id": "60110124",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "There's a certain gentleman I'd like to send off on his final journey."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601114",
      "subQuestName": "Follow Flins",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601102",
      "subQuestName": "Follow Flins",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60110201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60110201": {
            "id": "60110201",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "This man was like a lighthouse...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110202"
            ]
          },
          "60110202": {
            "id": "60110202",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Here he lived, as if it were a mere matter of course, and brought light and grace to those around him. But people, once used to illumination, are apt to ignore the lantern's presence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110203"
            ]
          },
          "60110203": {
            "id": "60110203",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Slowly, gradually, he came to think as such himself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110204"
            ]
          },
          "60110204": {
            "id": "60110204",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "\"I have achieved too little, I must do better, there is more work to be done...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110205"
            ]
          },
          "60110205": {
            "id": "60110205",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Perhaps his end was tragic, but I remain proud of the way in which he illuminated the path for others.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110206"
            ]
          },
          "60110206": {
            "id": "60110206",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Every shadow born of the light shall remember it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110207"
            ]
          },
          "60110207": {
            "id": "60110207",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Poor guy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110208"
            ]
          },
          "60110208": {
            "id": "60110208",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I once heard the tale of a Lantern Fae.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110209"
            ]
          },
          "60110209": {
            "id": "60110209",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Heh. I've heard that one, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110212"
            ]
          },
          "60110212": {
            "id": "60110212",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Is that so?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110213"
            ]
          },
          "60110213": {
            "id": "60110213",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Well, you're right. It may seem that our efforts were in vain, that Rerir achieved his goals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110214"
            ]
          },
          "60110214": {
            "id": "60110214",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "But we will pursue him to the last, even if the outcome is not what we wish for.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110215"
            ]
          },
          "60110215": {
            "id": "60110215",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "It is not dissimilar to the role of a Graveyard Keeper...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110216"
            ]
          },
          "60110216": {
            "id": "60110216",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "We do not seek to bring the dead back to life, only to grant them peace.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110217"
            ]
          },
          "60110217": {
            "id": "60110217",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm glad to hear that's how you see it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110218"
            ]
          },
          "60110218": {
            "id": "60110218",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Yeah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110219"
            ]
          },
          "60110219": {
            "id": "60110219",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wh—What are you two talking about? Care to explain?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110220"
            ]
          },
          "60110220": {
            "id": "60110220",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Not right now, Paimon. I'll tell you when we get back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110221"
            ]
          },
          "60110221": {
            "id": "60110221",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Okay...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110222"
            ]
          },
          "60110222": {
            "id": "60110222",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Either way, the Lantern Fae is not playing the leading role in these final rites.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110223"
            ]
          },
          "60110223": {
            "id": "60110223",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "\"Light-bearer, with your blood, you have paved the road to glory and justice.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110224"
            ]
          },
          "60110224": {
            "id": "60110224",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "\"Even as we hurry on, bruised and battered though we may be, stay awhile and look back upon the world and all its love and hatred.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110225"
            ]
          },
          "60110225": {
            "id": "60110225",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "\"Until it closes its eyes in the depths of night, and a lantern lit for you alone flickers softly into life.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110226"
            ]
          },
          "60110226": {
            "id": "60110226",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Thank you for everything, Sergeant Major Sousi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601110",
      "subQuestName": "Follow Luonnotar",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60110801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60110801": {
            "id": "60110801",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "Flins? Don't see you coming around here often. Just feel free to take a look. I'm busy right now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110802"
            ]
          },
          "60110802": {
            "id": "60110802",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Well, I've come to visit you, Miss Aino. Here — I've brought some snacks from town in their traditional butter flavor. So, where should I leave them...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110803"
            ]
          },
          "60110803": {
            "id": "60110803",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "Shh! ... Ineffa might hear you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110804"
            ]
          },
          "60110804": {
            "id": "60110804",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "...So, what's the occasion? Are you... gonna to say that the Ratniki will be taking over all Wild Hunt incidents after that hiccup with the cannon?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110805"
            ]
          },
          "60110805": {
            "id": "60110805",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "And criticize a genius like yourself on account of results that none of us could anticipate? We would not be that crass.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110806"
            ]
          },
          "60110806": {
            "id": "60110806",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "If we really did do that, I daresay we shall never again see technological breakthroughs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110807"
            ]
          },
          "60110807": {
            "id": "60110807",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "Hmph. Sweet-talker...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110808"
            ]
          },
          "60110808": {
            "id": "60110808",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "It gladdens me to have set your heart at ease.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110809"
            ]
          },
          "60110809": {
            "id": "60110809",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "Anyway, what's the matter, exactly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110810"
            ]
          },
          "60110810": {
            "id": "60110810",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Well. Could you help me repair this lantern? I did bring it to Nasha Town to get it fixed, but it broke again during our previous battle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110811"
            ]
          },
          "60110811": {
            "id": "60110811",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "You want a genius like me to go fix a lantern?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110812"
            ]
          },
          "60110812": {
            "id": "60110812",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Oh, my apologies. Perhaps this request should be better directed to Miss Ineffa, and perhaps the snacks too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110813"
            ]
          },
          "60110813": {
            "id": "60110813",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "Wh—Wh—Wh... I... I mean, I can totally do this, no problem. Wait right there. I'll be done before you can say \"Fix-it!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110814"
            ]
          },
          "60110814": {
            "id": "60110814",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Much obliged, then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110815"
            ]
          },
          "60110815": {
            "id": "60110815",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "And next time this happens to you, make sure to come to me first, you hear?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601103",
      "subQuestName": "Follow Luonnotar",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60110401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60110401": {
            "id": "60110401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Krumkake creation complete. Please, enjoy while it's hot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110402"
            ]
          },
          "60110402": {
            "id": "60110402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Thank you for going to the trouble of remembering that, Miss Ineffa. May this taste bear witness to a friendship that will endure forever and a day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110403"
            ]
          },
          "60110403": {
            "id": "60110403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Understood. However, I fear that krumkakes do not keep for that long. A week at most may pass before their taste deteriorates.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110404"
            ]
          },
          "60110404": {
            "id": "60110404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Hehe, that's not quite what I meant by... Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110405"
            ]
          },
          "60110405": {
            "id": "60110405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Oh? We appear to have some guests.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110406"
            ]
          },
          "60110406": {
            "id": "60110406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Ah, they must have followed the aroma of the krumkake... It's alright, come closer. Ineffa is a friend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110407"
            ]
          },
          "60110407": {
            "id": "60110407",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Affirmative. In fact, I can devise a cereal omelette based on individual preferences, before crushing it into servings to share around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110408"
            ]
          },
          "60110408": {
            "id": "60110408",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110409"
            ]
          },
          "60110409": {
            "id": "60110409",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "What are they saying?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110410"
            ]
          },
          "60110410": {
            "id": "60110410",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "They... are discussing your address. They wish to go home with you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601109",
      "subQuestName": "Follow Luonnotar",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60110501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60110501": {
            "id": "60110501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jahoda",
            "text": "Boss, I... Do you remember that thing... that I wanted to ask your opinion about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110502"
            ]
          },
          "60110502": {
            "id": "60110502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jahoda",
            "text": "On a scale of 1 to 10, how much effort should the Curatorium of Secrets put in if we were to work with others again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110503"
            ]
          },
          "60110503": {
            "id": "60110503",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Hehe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110504"
            ]
          },
          "60110504": {
            "id": "60110504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jahoda",
            "text": "Is that a 1? Isn't that kinda low...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110505"
            ]
          },
          "60110505": {
            "id": "60110505",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Guess again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110506"
            ]
          },
          "60110506": {
            "id": "60110506",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jahoda",
            "text": "Wait, you mean zero? But wouldn't we just be slapping our brand on the joint venture and calling it a day? Why even team up at that point?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110507"
            ]
          },
          "60110507": {
            "id": "60110507",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "*sigh* ...Jahoda.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110508"
            ]
          },
          "60110508": {
            "id": "60110508",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "What I mean to say is that there is neither an upper nor lower limit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110509"
            ]
          },
          "60110509": {
            "id": "60110509",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jahoda",
            "text": "Huh! That's just like you, Boss, always thinking ahead...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110510"
            ]
          },
          "60110510": {
            "id": "60110510",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jahoda",
            "text": "Wait a minute, that's not an answer at all, is it? C'mon, just give me a number, boss, please!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601111",
      "subQuestName": "Follow Luonnotar",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60110901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60110901": {
            "id": "60110901",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "Hmm? What brings you here? Didn't expect to see you around again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110902"
            ]
          },
          "60110902": {
            "id": "60110902",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And where have you been, huh? Didn't run away or anything, did ya?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110903"
            ]
          },
          "60110903": {
            "id": "60110903",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "Oh, of course not! I was simply elsewhere discussing business deals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110904"
            ]
          },
          "60110904": {
            "id": "60110904",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "Indeed, it was all thanks to you that my little store was saved. *sob* I am grateful. So grateful...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110905"
            ]
          },
          "60110905": {
            "id": "60110905",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Okay, okay, you can cut it with the acting now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110906"
            ]
          },
          "60110906": {
            "id": "60110906",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "What? Why, I wasn't acting in the slightest!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110907"
            ]
          },
          "60110907": {
            "id": "60110907",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "And didn't I tell you that my prices were reasonable? Ah, but you still turned to that Curatorium of Secrets, or whatever it is they call it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110908"
            ]
          },
          "60110908": {
            "id": "60110908",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "*sigh* If even regulars such as you abandon ship like this, what can a businesswoman do but take her wares elsewhere...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110909"
            ]
          },
          "60110909": {
            "id": "60110909",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You're way too wary of the Curatorium...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110910"
            ]
          },
          "60110910": {
            "id": "60110910",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "And how should I not be, hmm? Running small overseas enterprises is no mean feat — never mind when such formidable competition exists...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110911"
            ]
          },
          "60110911": {
            "id": "60110911",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "Ah, forget it. Fortune and destiny are as one, so there is no use complaining.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110912"
            ]
          },
          "60110912": {
            "id": "60110912",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "It's not as if Nefer did me no favors on account of our common homeland when I first arrived.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110913"
            ]
          },
          "60110913": {
            "id": "60110913",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "If anything is to blame, it is the lack of opportunity to have her owe me in turn, big time!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110914"
            ]
          },
          "60110914": {
            "id": "60110914",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "Now then! Should she ever need anything, you make sure — no, make doubly sure — to inform me first, alright?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
