    {
      "subId": "601106",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to The Damselette",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60110601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60110601": {
            "id": "60110601",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Columbina! What are you doing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110602"
            ]
          },
          "60110602": {
            "id": "60110602",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Hmm? Was it not you who recommended such walkabouts to me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110603"
            ]
          },
          "60110603": {
            "id": "60110603",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, but aren't you afraid the Fatui will see you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110604"
            ]
          },
          "60110604": {
            "id": "60110604",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Sandrone seems uninterested in my capture, and the others are unlikely to risk making contact at all. They have more troublesome affairs to deal with.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110605"
            ]
          },
          "60110605": {
            "id": "60110605",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Rerir, if I had to guess... He is a threat to all who live in Nod-Krai.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110606"
            ]
          },
          "60110606": {
            "id": "60110606",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, it's good to come out for a walk either way. So, how do you feel? Is Nasha Town to your liking?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110607"
            ]
          },
          "60110607": {
            "id": "60110607",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Mmm... The flow of kuuvahki is somewhat turbulent, and the people are ill at ease.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110608"
            ]
          },
          "60110608": {
            "id": "60110608",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "However...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110609"
            ]
          },
          "60110609": {
            "id": "60110609",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "However?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110610"
            ]
          },
          "60110610": {
            "id": "60110610",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Is this where you purchased the dishes you \"treated\" me to?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110611"
            ]
          },
          "60110611": {
            "id": "60110611",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "(Are you serious? That's what she's concerned about? Berries and Fried Meat?)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110612"
            ]
          },
          "60110612": {
            "id": "60110612",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um, well, we can take you to grab a bite if you'd like to. There's all sorts of delicious stuff out here that you won't get to try at home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110613"
            ]
          },
          "60110613": {
            "id": "60110613",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "...You've been quite subdued. Thorny questions on your mind, perhaps?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110615"
            ]
          },
          "60110615": {
            "id": "60110615",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "I could not gain any insight into his schemes, I fear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110616"
            ]
          },
          "60110616": {
            "id": "60110616",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Now that he has donned a shape and form, selling his power short would prove a fatal error.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110617"
            ]
          },
          "60110617": {
            "id": "60110617",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "But that power of his plays host to an obsession that borders on mania.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110618"
            ]
          },
          "60110618": {
            "id": "60110618",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "I cannot say if that fixation is directed at the moons or at something else...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110619"
            ]
          },
          "60110619": {
            "id": "60110619",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Perhaps understanding the subject of his fixation shall prove key to repelling him in the future..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601107",
      "subQuestName": "Epilogue",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60110701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60110701": {
            "id": "60110701",
            "speakerId": 1010,
            "speakerName": "\"Rächer of Solnari\"",
            "text": "...Interesting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110702"
            ]
          },
          "60110702": {
            "id": "60110702",
            "speakerId": 1010,
            "speakerName": "\"Rächer of Solnari\"",
            "text": "You've followed me this far. Why not show your face?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110703"
            ]
          },
          "60110703": {
            "id": "60110703",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Haha, right, right! Right you are. I forgot to introduce myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60110704"
            ]
          },
          "60110704": {
            "id": "60110704",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "The name's Varka. Knight of Boreas, and Grand Master of the Knights of Favonius."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601108",
      "subQuestName": "Epilogue",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601110",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60111001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60111001": {
            "id": "60111001",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "\"Fix my lantern,\" he says. Puh-lease! This won't take ten minutes!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60111002"
            ]
          },
          "60111002": {
            "id": "60111002",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "If only everyone knew what the heck they were doing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60111003"
            ]
          },
          "60111003": {
            "id": "60111003",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "Take that Hintsa for instance. How in the world do you end up creating an integrated controller for the cannon AND the barrier from random components people ask you to fix!? Ugh, gives me a headache just thinking about it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60111004"
            ]
          },
          "60111004": {
            "id": "60111004",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "I gave him a real earful, and told him to send me regular reports — if he's been working on it lately, I wanna hear about it! *sigh* Y—Yeah, I mean, I know I'm partly at fault too, alright?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601111",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60111101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60111101": {
            "id": "60111101",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "#Ah, fancy meeting you here, {NICKNAME}. I've decided my lantern has earned itself some thorough maintenance after that rather intense battle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60111102"
            ]
          },
          "60111102": {
            "id": "60111102",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Thank you for keeping my secrets, despite knowing as much as you do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60111105"
            ]
          },
          "60111105": {
            "id": "60111105",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Well, because otherwise, I'd get in trouble with the Starshyna. If they couldn't detect my own lantern, I suspect the higher-ups would foist a standard-issue Ratnik lantern on me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60111106"
            ]
          },
          "60111106": {
            "id": "60111106",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "A Ratnik carrying two lanterns — imagine that! It would be an aesthetic transgression of the highest order. Hehe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "601199",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60119901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60119901": {
            "id": "60119901",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, it's Luonnotar... Should we go after her? Or do you have someone else you'd like to meet?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}